title: login_k8s wipes a working token on 404 instead of croaking
updated: 2026-09-22T19:21:40Z
---

A 404 from auth/<k8s_auth_mount>/login (e.g. wrong mount) makes _request return undef; login_k8s then sets token to undef and returns {}. It should croak. Error-contract change: needs tickets for goldmine and hiplatform consumers.
